! Megh.scl
!
Megh in D# - Nadi (just intonation). Monsoon pentatonic: Sa, Re, Ma, Pa, komal Ni. No third, so it leans neither major nor minor.
!
 5
!
 9/8
 4/3
 3/2
 9/5
 2/1
!
! Scale degrees (the annotations that used to sit on the pitch lines):
!   Re    203.91 cents
!   Ma    498.04 cents
!   Pa    701.96 cents
!   ni   1017.60 cents
!   Sa'  1200.00 cents
!
! Matches Nadi's internal tuning exactly, so instruments in this tuning
! and Nadi's resonators lock together instead of beating.
! Sattvagenic - sattvagenic.com/nadi
! Intended root: D#3 = 311.1270 Hz — set your synth's base/root note to D#.
